# Public-prefixed env vars are inlined into the client bundle by Astro
# at build time. NEVER put real secrets here — anything a browser sees
# is public. For private secrets use a server-side proxy or unprefixed
# vars consumed only in build scripts.

# === Analytics =======================================================
PUBLIC_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID=
PUBLIC_YANDEX_METRIKA_ID=
PUBLIC_YANDEX_VERIFICATION=
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=

# === Ozon lead form =================================================
# The Ozon lead form posts to the `ozon-lead` Cloudflare Worker
# (workers/ozon-lead/). The referrer phone and the Telegram bot token
# are Worker-side secrets set via `wrangler secret put` — they are NEVER
# `PUBLIC_`-prefixed, because a `PUBLIC_` var is inlined verbatim into
# every static page's client bundle. See workers/ozon-lead/wrangler.toml
# for the secret list and setup steps.
